---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="The Presence Audit"
  description="The Presence Audit is the checklist used before a home AI system is listed in The Presence Directory."
>
  <article class="prose-wrap">
    <p class="kicker">Review before listing</p>
    <h1>The Presence Audit</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      A system does not land here because it is clever. It lands here if it can serve a household without stealing the evening.
    </p>
    <div class="stack">
      <p>
        The Presence Audit is the checklist used before a listing is published. The aim is simple: would this tool help an executive dad be present with the people entrusted to him, or would it pull him back into a screen?
      </p>
      <p>
        The checklist itself belongs in the marked space below. Until it is pasted in, this page holds the placeholder only. No items, scores, or pass rates are invented here.
      </p>
    </div>
    <aside class="checklist-placeholder" role="note" aria-label="Checklist placeholder">
      <p class="kicker">Placeholder. Paste below this label.</p>
      <p class="checklist-copy">Christopher to paste checklist as-is</p>
    </aside>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
